      "type": "h1",
      "text": "5. The only three irregular verbs"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "<b>Ser</b>, <b>ir</b> and <b>ver</b> are the only irregular verbs in the imperfect. Every other verb, including stem-changers and verbs with irregular present or preterite forms, is regular here."
    },
    {
      "type": "conj",
      "tense": "imperfect",
      "verb": "ser",
      "meaning": "to be",
      "label": "irregular verb",
